(text "Main I2C bus: expanders 0x20/0x21, Digimatic ATtiny 0x30, ADS1219 #1 0x40, ADS1219 #2 0x41, TCA9548A 0x70." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 21b87c2f-24af-4ef1-8271-d9e21168f370))
(text "ADS1219 #2 moved from mux channel 4 to the main bus at 0x41: at 0x40 behind the mux it would clash with ADS1219 #1." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 36243d1b-f8df-442b-bce2-1b902c547d03))
